# Contracts module (PDF). Authenticate with a JWT (Authorization: Bearer ...).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@contractId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Generate the contract PDF (application/pdf, saved by the client as ZM-YYYY-NNNNNN.pdf)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
